CowSwapModule_CancelOrder
├── when order is unknown
│   └── it should revert with UnknownOrder
├── when caller is not the order node
│   └── it should revert with NotOrderOwner
├── given order status is settled
│   └── it should revert with OrderNotPending
├── given order status is cancelled
│   └── it should revert with OrderNotPending
└── given order is pending
    ├── given solver already pulled sell token
    │   ├── it should set order status to cancelled
    │   ├── it should emit OrderCancelled with zero amount
    │   └── it should not transfer any tokens
    └── given sell token is still in module
        ├── it should set order status to cancelled
        ├── it should revoke sell token approval to cow settlement
        ├── it should transfer sell tokens back to node
        └── it should emit OrderCancelled event
